      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Dear Tupper, \nCan you also consider this post here for Vietnamese community?\nWe have around 45 votes in this request as below:\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/make-option-for-choosing-vietnamese-language?fbclid=IwAR07TPFClK3fQi_QGtrgObGTCX6XSWoOz23D4AF9yxhIfeqSDpJCoCcfWgI",
